  "description": "Enterprise-grade, extensible chart component framework for .NET 8.0 applications.\n\t\t\tProvides configurable, metadata-driven chart rendering with support for multiple\n\t\t\tchart types, templates, and interactive visualization capabilities. Enables dynamic\n\t\t\tchart generation and widget orchestration through Rule-Based Access Control (RBAC)\n\t\t\tto manage chart visibility, behavior, personalization, and access based on user\n\t\t\troles, groups, and individual identities.\n\n\t\t\tSupports dashboard-driven visualization, reusable widget configurations, and\n\t\t\tdynamic filter-based data retrieval across distributed enterprise systems.\n\t\t\tDesigned using Clean Architecture and Ports and Adapters principles to ensure\n\t\t\tscalability, maintainability, and seamless integration across Web APIs,\n\t\t\tmicroservices, and modular enterprise platforms.\n\n\t\t\tIncludes extensibility for custom chart templates, dispatcher-based execution,\n\t\t\tand adapter-driven data sources, enabling organizations to build consistent,\n\t\t\tsecure, and high-performance analytical dashboards.",
